config TOUCHSCREEN_GOODIX_BRL_RODIN
	tristate "Goodix BRL touch driver for rodin"
	depends on TOUCHSCREEN_XIAOMI_TOUCH_RODIN
	default n
	help
	  Goodix brl-series touch IC driver (goodix_core_rodin) built-in port.
	  SPI bus binding: compatible "xiaomi,touch-spi" competes with the
	  focaltech rodin driver; first probed driver claims the device
	  (stock 6.6 behavior, per-unit IC population decides the winner).
